second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Who is Bronwen MacDonald Milner's spouse?\", \"slot_hint\": \"person\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 120, \"text\": \"As I sat in the dusty archives, surrounded by yellowed papers and forgotten memories, I stumbled upon a peculiar letter.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 121, \"end\": 233, \"text\": \"The faded ink and worn creases seemed to whisper secrets of the past, drawing me in with an otherworldly allure.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 234, \"end\": 378, \"text\": \"The letter was addressed to Bronwen MacDonald Milner, a name that echoed through the chambers of my mind like a gentle breeze on a summer's day.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 379, \"end\": 532, \"text\": \"As I delved deeper into the correspondence, I discovered that Bronwen was a woman of refined taste and intellect, with a passion for botany and the arts.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 533, \"end\": 629, \"text\": \"Her words danced across the page, painting vivid pictures of her life in the Scottish Highlands.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 630, \"end\": 716, \"text\": \"But it was the mention of her partner, Annie Macgregor Lyle, that caught my attention.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 717, \"end\": 871, \"text\": \"The way Bronwen spoke of Annie, with a tenderness and devotion that bordered on reverence, hinted at a love that transcended the boundaries of convention.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 872, \"end\": 996, \"text\": \"I imagined Bronwen and Annie strolling through the heather-covered moors, hand in hand, as the sun dipped below the horizon.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 997, \"end\": 1130, \"text\": \"They would stop at the edge of a tranquil loch, where Annie would recite poetry, her voice carrying on the wind like a gentle melody.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1131, \"end\": 1245, \"text\": \"Bronwen would listen, entranced, her eyes shining with adoration as she sketched the beauty of their surroundings.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1246, \"end\": 1322, \"text\": \"As I continued to read, I found myself lost in the world of these two women.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1323, \"end\": 1505, \"text\": \"I pictured them hosting salons in their Edinburgh townhouse, where they would gather with fellow intellectuals and artists to discuss the latest literary and scientific advancements.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1506, \"end\": 1674, \"text\": \"Annie, with her quick wit and sharp tongue, would regale the guests with stories of her travels, while Bronwen would charm them with her knowledge of the natural world.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1675, \"end\": 1771, \"text\": \"The more I read, the more I became convinced that Bronwen and Annie were more than just friends.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1772, \"end\": 1884, \"text\": \"The way they spoke of each other, the way they shared their joys and sorrows, hinted at a deep and abiding love.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1885, \"end\": 2015, \"text\": \"It was as if they had found a sense of home in each other, a sense of belonging that transcended the societal norms of their time.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2016, \"end\": 2077, \"text\": \"As I closed the letter, a sense of wonder lingered within me.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2078, \"end\": 2205, \"text\": \"I felt as though I had stumbled upon a hidden treasure, a glimpse into a world that was both familiar and yet, utterly foreign.\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2206, \"end\": 2370, \"text\": \"The love between Bronwen and Annie was a beacon of hope, a reminder that even in the darkest of times, there was always the possibility of finding one's true north.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 28, \"text\": \"**Bronwen MacDonald Milner**\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 30, \"end\": 132, \"text\": \"Bronwen MacDonald Milner is a British peerage personality, identified by her Peerage person ID 229865.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 133, \"end\": 150, \"text\": \"**Personal Life**\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 152, \"end\": 250, \"text\": \"Bronwen MacDonald Milner is married to Jeremy Neville Stopford, a British individual born in 1958.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 251, \"end\": 263, \"text\": \"**Evidence**\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 265, \"end\": 383, \"text\": \"The marriage between Bronwen MacDonald Milner and Jeremy Neville Stopford is supported by credible sources, including:\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 385, \"end\": 569, \"text\": \"* **Peerage.com**: According to Peerage.com, a reliable online database of British peerage and aristocracy, Bronwen MacDonald Milner is listed as the spouse of Jeremy Neville Stopford.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 570, \"end\": 573, \"text\": \"[1]\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 574, \"end\": 766, \"text\": \"* **ThePeerage.com**: ThePeerage.com, another trusted online resource for British peerage and nobility, also confirms the marriage between Bronwen MacDonald Milner and Jeremy Neville Stopford.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 767, \"end\": 770, \"text\": \"[2]\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 771, \"end\": 953, \"text\": \"* **Burke's Peerage**: Burke's Peerage, a renowned publication on British genealogy and peerage, lists Bronwen MacDonald Milner as the wife of Jeremy Neville Stopford in its records.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 954, \"end\": 957, \"text\": \"[3]\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 959, \"end\": 1105, \"text\": \"These credible sources collectively provide strong evidence for the statement that Bronwen MacDonald Milner is married to Jeremy Neville Stopford.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1106, \"end\": 1120, \"text\": \"**References**\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1122, \"end\": 1138, \"text\": \"[1] Peerage.com.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1139, \"end\": 1146, \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1147, \"end\": 1172, \"text\": \"Bronwen MacDonald Milner.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1173, \"end\": 1228, \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.peerage.com\\\\/p229865.htm>\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1230, \"end\": 1249, \"text\": \"[2] ThePeerage.com.\"}, \"D2S20\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1250, \"end\": 1257, \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, \"D2S21\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start